~ start
set reset = false
set wizard_started = true
set white_finished = false
set white_started = true
if white_encountered == true
	=> riddle
else 
	=> intro
	
~ riddle 
set white_waiting = true

~ first
set white_waiting = true
White Wizard: With {{first_word}}, {{second_word}}, and {{third_word}} now found, let magic turn this stone around!
	
	Say the first word…
.....[speed=0.1][next=auto]
if error == false
	White Wizard: Did you say… {{last_word}}?
	- Yes
		set first_word = last_word
		set error = true
		=> second
	- No
		set error = true
		=> first
	- Quit
		set error = true
		=> end
else
	White Wizard: Wait, I didn’t quite catch that. Could you say that word again?
	=> first

~ second
White Wizard: With {{first_word}}, {{second_word}}, and {{third_word}} now found, let magic turn this stone around!
	
	Now, the second word…
.....[speed=0.1][next=auto]
if error == false
	White Wizard: Did you say… {{last_word}}?
	- Yes
		set second_word = last_word
		set error = true
		=> third
	- No
		set error = true
		=> second
	- Quit
		set error = true
		=> end
else
	White Wizard: Wait, I didn’t quite catch that. Could you say that word again?
	=> second
	
~ third
White Wizard: With {{first_word}}, {{second_word}}, and {{third_word}} now found, let magic turn this stone around!
	
	Finally, say the last word...
.....[speed=0.1][next=auto]
if error == false
	White Wizard: Did you say… {{last_word}}?
	- Yes
		set third_word = last_word
		set error = true
		=> check
	- No
		set error = true
		=> third
	- Quit
		set error = true
		=> end
else
	White Wizard: Wait, I didn’t quite catch that. Could you say that word again?
	=> third

~ check
set check = true
White Wizard: Ah, everything is in place. Let’s see if the spell works!
=> result

~ result
if correct == true
	set reset = true
	White Wizard: Ah, yes! You did it! The spell is complete! You may proceed...
    => end
else
	set reset = true
	White Wizard: Hmm… that didn’t work at all. The spell didn’t activate! Something must have been wrong with one of the words...
	White Wizard: Try again, but this time, be sure to get every word exactly right!
	- Retry
		=> first
	- Quit
		=> end

~ end
set reset = true
set wizard_finished = true
set white_finished = true
=> END

~ intro
White Wizard: Oh, thank goodness, someone with a brain! You there, help us! 
White Wizard: We were so close to perfecting the spell to turn stone into gold, but that bumbling intern ruined everything!
White Wizard: Ink everywhere! Now the key words are gone, and all we have are scraps of memory. 
White Wizard: Each of us remembers a piece, but none of us can solve it alone!
White Wizard: Listen carefully... Here’s the formula, what we can still read, at least. Fill in the missing words if you can!
set white_encountered = true
=> riddle